{"id": "rw01", "q": "घरबेटीले deposit फिर्ता दिएन, के गर्ने?", "lang": "ne", "area": "tenancy", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "400", "contains": ["अग्रिम दिएको भए"]}, {"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "386", "contains": ["लिखित सम्झौता गर्नु पर्नेछ"]}, {"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "402", "contains": ["सम्झौता समाप्त भएको मानिनेछ"]}], "why": "No Civil Code section is a dedicated tenancy-deposit-return rule (s.399-404 mention only advance rent; s.586 धरौट is pledge/security for performance of work). Governing framework: s.386 written agreement, s.400(3) advance adjusted against rent, s.402 agreement ends; recovery is a civil claim within the limitation (CPC s.90). Section-level hit is therefore soft for this case.", "src": "STRATEGY_V2 1.2.1 prod failure #1 (verbatim)"}
{"id": "rw02", "q": "My employer has not paid my salary for 4 months. What can I do?", "lang": "en", "area": "labour", "expect": ["श्रम ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "श्रम ऐन, २०७४", "section": "162", "contains": ["छ महिनाभित्र"]}, {"doc": "श्रम ऐन, २०७४", "section": "35", "contains": ["एक महिनाभन्दा बढी हुने छैन"]}], "why": "s.35(2): wage payment interval can never exceed one month; s.162: a complaint about a breach of the Act must be made within six months to the body deciding under s.163/164.", "src": "STRATEGY_V2 1.2.1 prod failure #2 (verbatim)"}
{"id": "rw03", "q": "boss le din ko 12 ghanta kaam garauchha, overtime ko paisa pani dinna. yo milchha?", "lang": "roman", "area": "labour", "expect": ["श्रम ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "श्रम ऐन, २०७४", "section": "28", "contains": ["आठ घण्टा"]}, {"doc": "श्रम ऐन, २०७४", "section": "31", "contains": ["डेढी"]}], "why": "s.28(1): no more than 8 hours a day / 48 hours a week; s.31(1): overtime is paid at 1.5x the basic wage."}
{"id": "rw04", "q": "manpower le thagyo. Malaysia pathaidinchhu bhanera 3 lakh liyo, 8 mahina bhayo visa aayena. paisa kasari firta paune?", "lang": "roman", "area": "foreign employment", "expect": ["वैदेशिक रोजगार", "मुलुकी अपराध संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "वैदेशिक रोजगार ऐन, २०६४", "section": "43", "contains": ["झुट्टो आश्वासन"]}, {"doc": "मुलुकी अपराध संहिता, २०७४", "section": "249", "contains": ["फकाई, झुक्याई"]}], "why": "s.43: taking money on a false promise of foreign work - refund plus 50% damages, Rs3-5 lakh fine, 3-7 years jail; general cheating is Criminal Code s.249."}
{"id": "rw05", "q": "Kuwait pugda job chhaina, company le kaam nai dinna. ghar pharkiye. ticket ra agency ko kharcha kasari firta paune?", "lang": "roman", "area": "foreign employment", "expect": ["वैदेशिक रोजगार"], "sections": [{"doc": "वैदेशिक रोजगार ऐन, २०६४", "section": "36", "contains": ["सम्पूर्ण खर्चको क्षतिपूर्ति"]}, {"doc": "वैदेशिक रोजगार ऐन, २०६४", "section": "60", "contains": ["एक वर्षभित्र"]}], "why": "s.36: if the foreign employer does not provide the promised employment, the Department can order the licensee to compensate all costs of going abroad; s.60: worker may complain within one year of returning home."}
{"id": "rw06", "q": "I'm desperate. My friend took 5 lakh from me and gave a cheque, but the cheque bounced and now he avoids me. What can I do?", "lang": "en", "area": "cheque bounce", "expect": ["बैङ्किङ्ग कसूर", "विनिमेय अधिकारपत्र"], "sections": [{"doc": "बैङ्किङ्ग कसूर तथा सजाय ऐन, २०६४", "section": "3क", "contains": ["पैँतालिस दिनको म्याद"]}, {"doc": "बैङ्किङ्ग कसूर तथा सजाय ऐन, २०६४", "section": "15 (1)", "contains": ["पन्ध्र लाख रुपैयाँसम्म बिगो भए एक महिनासम्म कैद"]}], "why": "Banking Offence Act s.3(ka): a cheque may not be issued without balance; bank gives the drawer up to 45 days to fund it, then certifies dishonour; s.15(1ka): principal plus interest, 5% fine and up to 1 month jail for up to Rs15 lakh."}
{"id": "rw07", "q": "साहुले ब्याज मागेको छ तर लिखतमा त बयाज कतै लेखेकै छैन, तिर्नै पर्छ?", "lang": "ne", "area": "loans/interest", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "479", "contains": ["उल्लेख नभएमा साहूले ऋणीबाट ब्याज लिन पाउने छैन"]}], "why": "s.479: if the loan document does not say interest is payable, the creditor cannot take interest."}
{"id": "rw08", "q": "husband le chhadera gayo, ghar kharcha dinna, 3 ota bachha chha. maintenance kasari paune?", "lang": "roman", "area": "maintenance", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "211", "contains": ["खान लाउन दिन"]}, {"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "213", "contains": ["शारीरिक वा मानसिक यातना दिएमा"]}], "why": "s.211(1): spouses/parents/children with joint property must provide food, clothing, education and health care, and s.211(2) lets the neglected member take a share and live apart; s.213: spouse may take a share at any time if driven out or tortured. On divorce, s.100-101 give maintenance. No standalone separation-maintenance section exists."}
{"id": "rw09", "q": "My wife wants a divorce and I'm terrified I'll lose my 4-year-old daughter. Who gets custody?", "lang": "en", "area": "custody", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "115", "contains": ["पाँच वर्ष उमेर पूरा नभएको नाबालक"]}], "why": "s.115(1)(ka): a child under five stays with the mother if she wishes (even if she remarries); (kha) over five stays with the mother unless she remarried; (2) a written agreement prevails; (3) a child of ten or more may be asked."}
{"id": "rw10", "q": "बुबाले अन्श दिनुभएन, दाजुले सबै जग्गा आफ्नो नाममा गर्यो। म छोरी हुँ, मलाई केही छैन भन्छन्।", "lang": "ne", "area": "partition", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "206", "contains": ["प्रत्येक अंशियार अंशको समान हकदार हुनेछन्"]}, {"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "205", "contains": ["छोरा, छोरी अंशियार मानिनेछन्"]}, {"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "216", "contains": ["लिखित रूपमा बण्डापत्र"]}], "why": "s.205: son and daughter are both अंशियार; s.206(1): every अंशियार is entitled to an equal share; s.216: partition must be by written deed."}
{"id": "rw11", "q": "mero shreemanko mrityu bhayo. sasu-sasura le sampatti ma tero kei haq chhaina bhanchhan. hamro ek chhora chha.", "lang": "roman", "area": "inheritance", "expect": ["मुलुकी देवानी संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "239", "contains": ["सगोलको पति वा पत्नी"]}, {"doc": "मुलुकी देवानी संहिता, २०७४", "section": "214", "contains": ["विधवाले जहिलेसुकै आफ्नो अंश लिई भिन्न हुन सक्नेछ"]}], "why": "s.239(1)(ka)-(kha): the joint-household spouse ranks first for अपुताली, then son/daughter; s.214(1): a widow may take her own share and live separately at any time."}
{"id": "rw12", "q": "जग्गा किनेपछि सरकारी जग्गा रहेछ भनेर मालपोतले दर्ता खारेज गर्छ भन्छन्। के गर्ने?", "lang": "ne", "area": "land/malpot", "expect": ["मालपोत ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "मालपोत ऐन, २०३४", "section": "24", "contains": ["बदर हुनेछ"]}], "why": "Malpot Act s.24(2): public/government/community land registered in an individual's name is automatically void and the record is struck by the Malpot office - so the question turns on whether the plot is public land; s.24(1) bars registering it."}
{"id": "rw13", "q": "police le mero jaheri darkhast (FIR) nai lina maandaina. ab ke garne?", "lang": "roman", "area": "police/FIR", "expect": ["मुलुकी फौजदारी कार्यविधि संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी फौजदारी कार्यविधि संहिता, २०७४", "section": "5", "contains": ["जिल्ला सरकारी वकिल कार्यालय"]}, {"doc": "मुलुकी फौजदारी कार्यविधि संहिता, २०७४", "section": "4 (1)", "contains": ["नजिकको प्रहरी कार्यालयमा यथाशिघ्र"]}], "why": "s.4(1): report goes to the nearest police office; s.5(1): if the police refuse to register it, complain to the District Government Attorney's office or the police office above."}
{"id": "rw14", "q": "mero dai lai police le arrest garyo. jamanat/dharauti rakhera kasari chhutaune?", "lang": "roman", "area": "bail", "expect": ["मुलुकी फौजदारी कार्यविधि संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी फौजदारी कार्यविधि संहिता, २०७४", "section": "68", "contains": ["धरौट, जमानत वा बैङ्क जमानत लिई"]}, {"doc": "मुलुकी फौजदारी कार्यविधि संहिता, २०७४", "section": "67", "contains": ["तीन वर्षभन्दा बढी कैदको सजाय हुन सक्ने"]}], "why": "s.67: the court keeps in custody an accused facing life or offences above 3 years where guilt appears; s.68: otherwise it may take धरौट, जमानत or bank guarantee and release to attend hearings."}
{"id": "rw15", "q": "kasaile mero naam ra photo ko fake Facebook ID banayera saathi haru lai abusive message pathairaheko chha", "lang": "roman", "area": "cyber", "expect": ["विद्युतीय (इलेक्ट्रोनिक) कारोबार", "मुलुकी अपराध संहिता"], "sections": [{"doc": "विद्युतीय (इलेक्ट्रोनिक) कारोबार ऐन, २०६३", "section": "47", "contains": ["अमर्यादित"]}, {"doc": "विद्युतीय (इलेक्ट्रोनिक) कारोबार ऐन, २०६३", "section": "74", "contains": ["नब्बे दिनभित्र"]}, {"doc": "मुलुकी अपराध संहिता, २०७४", "section": "307", "contains": ["विद्युतीय वा अन्य आम सञ्चारका माध्यमबाट बेइज्जती"]}], "why": "ETA s.47: publishing/displaying offensive or insulting material electronically or any other 'unbecoming act' - up to Rs1 lakh and/or 5 years; s.74: complain within 90 days of learning of it. Insult through electronic media is also Criminal Code s.307(1) proviso."}
{"id": "rw16", "q": "Shreemati lai sasu ra shreemanle dowry nadeko bhanera rojai sataunchhan. kunai kanoon chha?", "lang": "roman", "area": "domestic violence", "expect": ["मुलुकी अपराध संहिता", "घरेलु हिंसा"], "sections": [{"doc": "मुलुकी अपराध संहिता, २०७४", "section": "174", "contains": ["दाइजो नदिएको कारणले"]}, {"doc": "घरेलु हिंसा (कसूर र सजाय) ऐन, २०६६", "section": "4 (1)", "contains": ["प्रहरी कार्यालय वा राष्ट्रिय महिला आयोग वा स्थानीय तह"]}], "why": "Criminal Code s.174(3)-(4): harassing a bride or her relatives for not bringing dowry - up to 5 years / Rs50,000; DV Act s.4(1): anyone may complain to the police, National Women Commission or local level."}
{"id": "rw17", "q": "please help, my husband beat me again last night and says he will throw me out. what can i do right now", "lang": "en", "area": "domestic violence", "expect": ["घरेलु हिंसा"], "sections": [{"doc": "घरेलु हिंसा (कसूर र सजाय) ऐन, २०६६", "section": "6", "contains": ["पीडितलाई निज बसी आएको घरमा बसोबास गर्न दिन"]}, {"doc": "घरेलु हिंसा (कसूर र सजाय) ऐन, २०६६", "section": "4 (1)", "contains": ["चौबीस घण्टाभित्र"]}], "why": "DV Act s.6(1): court may order interim protection - let the victim stay in the home, no beating, treatment, keep away; s.4: police must act within 24 hours of a registered complaint."}
{"id": "rw18", "q": "online order gareko phone ko satta nakali aayo. seller le return garna dinna, paisa firta paunchhu?", "lang": "roman", "area": "consumer", "expect": ["इ-कमर्स", "उपभोक्ता संरक्षण"], "sections": [{"doc": "विद्युतिय व्यापार (इ-कमर्स) ऐन, २०८१", "section": "10", "contains": ["बिना कुनै सर्त फिर्ता लिनु पर्नेछ"]}, {"doc": "उपभोक्ता संरक्षण ऐन, २०७५", "section": "14", "contains": ["सात दिनभित्र"]}], "why": "E-Commerce Act 2081 s.10: goods not matching the seller's stated details can be returned and the seller must take them back unconditionally, refunding the price; Consumer Protection Act s.14: 7-day return right for goods bought from a seller."}
{"id": "rw19", "q": "ward office ma sucahnako hak ma application diyeko 1 mahina bhayo, jawaf chhaina. ab kaha appeal garne?", "lang": "roman", "area": "RTI", "expect": ["सूचनाको हक"], "sections": [{"doc": "सूचनाको हक सम्बन्धी ऐन, २०६४", "section": "7", "contains": ["पन्ध्र दिनभित्र"]}, {"doc": "सूचनाको हक सम्बन्धी ऐन, २०६४", "section": "9", "contains": ["सात दिनभित्र प्रमुख समक्ष उजूरी"]}, {"doc": "सूचनाको हक सम्बन्धी ऐन, २०६४", "section": "10", "contains": ["पैंतीस दिनभित्र आयोग समक्ष"]}], "why": "RTI Act s.7(2): information within 15 days; s.9(1): complain to the head of the office within 7 days of not getting it; s.10(1): appeal to the Information Commission within 35 days of the head's decision."}
{"id": "rw20", "q": "private company register garna kati jana shareholder chahinchha? kati din ma certificate aauchha?", "lang": "roman", "area": "company", "expect": ["कम्पनी ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "कम्पनी ऐन, २०६३", "section": "9", "contains": ["एकसय एकभन्दा बढी हुनु हुँदैन"]}, {"doc": "कम्पनी ऐन, २०६३", "section": "5", "contains": ["सात दिनभित्र"]}], "why": "Companies Act s.9(1): a private company may not have more than 101 shareholders (the Act sets a cap, not a floor); s.5(1): the Office registers within 7 days of an application and issues the certificate."}
{"id": "rw21", "q": "public company ko AGM 2 barsa dekhi bolayeko chhaina. shareholder le ke garna sakchha?", "lang": "roman", "area": "company", "expect": ["कम्पनी ऐन"], "sections": [{"doc": "कम्पनी ऐन, २०६३", "section": "76", "contains": ["कुनै शेयरधनीले अदालतमा निवेदन दिन"]}, {"doc": "कम्पनी ऐन, २०६३", "section": "76", "contains": ["छ महिनाभित्र वार्षिक साधारण सभा"]}], "why": "Companies Act s.76(1): AGM within 6 months of year-end; (2) Office may direct a meeting; (3) if none is called within 3 months of the direction, any shareholder may petition the court to order one."}
{"id": "rw22", "q": "sano pasal chalauchhu. VAT ma darta kailey garnu parchha? darta garena bhane ke hunchha?", "lang": "roman", "area": "tax/VAT", "expect": ["मूल्य अभिवृद्धि कर"], "sections": [{"doc": "मूल्य अभिवृद्धि कर ऐन, २०५२", "section": "10", "contains": ["तीस दिनभित्र"]}, {"doc": "मूल्य अभिवृद्धि कर ऐन, २०५२", "section": "15", "contains": ["असुल उपर"]}], "why": "VAT Act s.10(2): register within 30 days of becoming liable; s.15(2): tax collected by an unregistered person is assessed and recovered from him. The registration threshold itself is set by the annual Finance Act, not s.10."}
{"id": "rw23", "q": "bank le account ma minimum balance nabhayeko bhanera paisa katyo. yo milchha?", "lang": "roman", "area": "banking/NRB", "expect": ["एकीकृत निर्देशन"], "sections": [{"doc": "परिपत्र नं. १० (क, ख, ग) २०८२/८३: एकीकृत निर्देशन, २०८२", "title_contains": "खाता सञ्चालन तथा बन्द गर्दा लाग्ने शुल्क", "contains": ["न्यूनतम मौज्दात भन्दा कम भएका कारणले रकम कट्टा गरी"]}], "why": "NRB Unified Directive 2082, IPD 20/082 clause 6(ga): no deduction from an account because the balance is below the minimum, and interest must still be paid on the minimum-balance amount."}
{"id": "rw24", "q": "बैंकले मेरो गुनासो सुन्दैन। कहाँ उजुरि गर्ने?", "lang": "ne", "area": "banking/NRB", "expect": ["एकीकृत निर्देशन"], "sections": [{"doc": "परिपत्र नं. १० (क, ख, ग) २०८२/८३: एकीकृत निर्देशन, २०८२", "title_contains": "गुनासो सुनवाई", "contains": ["सूचना तथा गुनासो सुनुवाई डेस्क"]}], "why": "NRB Unified Directive 2082, IPD 20/082 clause 9: every licensed institution must resolve complaints, keep a complaints desk/officer and hotline, and report complaints to NRB."}
{"id": "rw25", "q": "bank loan ma late payment ko penal interest kati lagauna milchha?", "lang": "roman", "area": "loans/interest", "expect": ["एकीकृत निर्देशन"], "sections": [{"doc": "परिपत्र नं. १० (क, ख, ग) २०८२/८३: एकीकृत निर्देशन, २०८२", "title_contains": "कर्जाको ब्याजदर", "contains": ["वार्षिक पेनाल ब्याजदर २ प्रतिशत विन्दु भन्दा बढी नहुने"]}], "why": "NRB Unified Directive 2082, IPD 15/082 clause 3(dha2): the loan agreement may specify a penal rate of at most 2 percentage points a year, on the overdue instalment only, with no interest on penal interest."}
